          "Wrap each endive in a slice of ham like a little parcel and lay them side by side in a baking dish.",
          "Pour the sauce over so they're covered, and scatter the rest of the cheese on top.",
          "Into the oven at 200°C for 20-25 minutes, until it's bubbling at the edges and golden on top. Let it settle a few minutes before serving — it's hotter than it looks."
